title: Authorizations › Worklist › Cardinal payer signal
route: /authorizations?signal=1
intro: The one banner on the page: a single line about a payer trend, its info icon, the filter it switches on and the ways to turn that filter off or hide the banner. The same filter is also a button under 'More'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the banner text and the four affected requests (I-2207, I-2218, I-2271 at Site B and I-2236 at Site A) are seed data; nothing re-scores them live. The count is the affected open requests at the sites in view: Both sites four, Site A one, Site B three.
---
screen q "Authorizations"
decision d0 "Is an open request at the sites in view affected, and was the banner not dismissed?"
endx e0 "No banner, and no 'Cardinal payer signal' button under 'More'\n(none affected; a dismissed banner keeps the button)"
screen bn "One-line banner: 'Payer signal. Cardinal Health Plan: 31% more IOP continued-stay denials this week.'\nInfo icon, 'Review the four', X"
click inf "Hover or focus the info icon 'More about this signal'"
overlay tip "Tip: 'The denials were mostly for thin recertification evidence. Four of your open requests are affected, and the agents have re-scored them.'\nEsc closes it"
process wd "The words follow the count in view\n'Review the three'; for one: 'Review it', '... is affected ... re-scored it' and 'Showing the request affected by the Cardinal signal'"

click r "Click 'Review the four'"
click mb "Or: 'More' › click 'Cardinal payer signal · 4'"
store sf "The payer-signal filter turns on\nThe address gets ?signal=1"
screen ls "The table lists only the affected rows: '4 authorizations'\nChips: All 4, Needs attention 2, In progress 2, With the payer 2, Reviews this week 3"
screen chip "Chip under the filter bar\n'Showing the 4 affected by the Cardinal signal' with an X"
screen bb "The banner button reads 'Show all requests'\n'More' reads 'More · on'"

click sa "Click 'Show all requests'"
click cx "Click the X on the chip ('Remove the Cardinal signal filter')"
click cf "Click 'Clear filters'"
click mo "Click 'Cardinal payer signal · 4' under 'More' again"
process off "The filter turns off and ?signal=1 leaves the address\nEvery row returns, the chip goes, the button reads 'Review the four' again"

click dis "Click the X on the banner ('Dismiss signal')"
store hid "The banner stays hidden for the session, until the demo data is reset"
process stay "If the filter was on, it stays on\nThe chip, 'Clear filters' and the button under 'More' still turn it off"

click op "Click a row's button or its request ID"
goto gC "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › A row's action button"
process sh "Once an affected request is signed and sent it is no longer an open request\nThe number in the banner drops"

q --> d0
d0 -->|No| e0
d0 -->|Yes| bn --> wd
bn --> inf --> tip
bn --> r --> sf
q -.-> mb --> sf
sf --> ls
sf --> chip
sf --> bb
bb --> sa --> off
chip --> cx --> off
ls --> cf --> off
ls --> mo --> off
bn --> dis --> hid --> stay
ls --> op --> gC
ls -.-> sh
